{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_008_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e862bd8587aef031c162561b5d0c6c977aadc86e13d5e7549b98b36e2b918d1a", "ja": "センターを任された美奈子は、自分のこと\nそっちのけでメンバーのフォローを続け、\n場を盛り上げる。彼女のリラックス方法は\nいつも通りの、みんなへのお世話だった。\n育まれた温かい絆で、ステージは成功する。", "zh": "被选为Center的美奈子，\n总是将自己的事放在一旁，\n以协助团员为优先，让现场气氛热络起来。\n她放松的方法，就是一如既往地照顾大家。\n在彼此累积的深厚羁绊下，表演圆满落幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_008_1000_019min", "source_sha256": "1030ba9948d91d5146a5f2c0e73f5fbc0d680a2470dff59de01735d822ce532c", "ja": "あっ、育ちゃん、ひなたちゃん！\nレッスン終わったんだね、\nお疲れさま♪", "zh": "啊，小育、日向！\n练习结束了吧，\n你们辛苦啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_008_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "88fd206a72b66f1484bf11dca24e37862c33ae3052fe7be4a94a2d024bbb3d5e", "ja": "ジュース、冷蔵庫に\n冷やしておいたよ。\n飲んでね！", "zh": "我已经把果汁放到冰箱里了，\n要记得喝喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_008_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "e32e89c6d4f9e41bc6791e7aeb851c4a301c4ab6c1ef2a17efaec29731e58d9c", "ja": "わぁ、ありがとう♪\n美奈子さんが買ってきてくれたの？", "zh": "哇，谢谢♪\n是美奈子姊姊买给我们的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_008_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "39bb0878cafed08aad4b3693668a7326021c72f13c0dad531a0331ba6f4f0e6f", "ja": "うん！　ひなたちゃんは\nりんごジュース、育ちゃんは\nオレンジでよかったよね？", "zh": "嗯！日向喜欢苹果汁，\n小育喜欢柳橙汁对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_008_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "2070ad131b77ab62fbe372ea73abe003569cf22453c8323279279609b0521d67", "ja": "ありがとねえ、美奈子さん。\nあたし、リンゴジュースが\n大好きなんだべさ。", "zh": "谢谢你呢～美奈子。\n我最喜欢苹果汁了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_008_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "4cb85a511dd02cc34cb7f8c5b3990b8bf2fe2669ea7b1467c10ad215a41a6f1d", "ja": "本当？　よかった～。", "zh": "真的吗？太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
